<title>SRI LANKA: Tea Smallholder up on growth prospects.</title>
<headline>Tea Smallholder up on growth prospects.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Sri Lanka's Tea Smallholder Factories Ltd were up 2.7 percent or 50 cents to 19.25 on Thursday on early retail buying of 8,600 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors are bullish on shares in the tea sector or connected to it, because tea prices have been at record high levels so far this year,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Tea Smallholder Factories processes tea bought from small cultivators.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
